<title>SPAIN: Spain police find big cocaine stash, arrest three.</title>
<headline>Spain police find big cocaine stash, arrest three.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A police found 150 kg (300 lbs) of cocaine and arrested three suspects in a raid in the southern Spanish city of Jaen, local officials announced on Sunday.</p>
<p>Police said the cocaine had a street value of three billion pesetas ($23 million). They also seized 85 million pesetas ($650,000) and nine luxury cars.</p>
